                    <head xml:lang="eng">Second Part: year 5 of Rājendra Cōḻa</head>
                    <p>
                        I<choice><orig>nn</orig><reg>ṉṉ</reg></choice>um <hi rend="grantha"><supplied reason="lost">Id</supplied>de</hi>varkkē yāṇṭu 5-Āvatu
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Uyya-k-koṇṭār-vaḷanāṭṭu-t tiraim<choice><orig>u</orig><reg>ū</reg></choice>r-nāṭṭu
                        <lb n="9"/>tiru-v-āvaṭu-tuṟai Uṭaiya <hi rend="grantha">mahāde</hi>varkku In-nāṭṭu-p pērāvūr-nāṭṭu-k kāṟaṉūr-kāṟaṉūrār kiḻavaṉ kāḷaṉ caṅkara-nārāyaṇaṉum kāṟaṉūr kiḻavaṉ <hi rend="check">ka</hi>ṉan=ti<!--See kaṉakaṉan=ti below--> Aṭikaḷum kāṟaṉūr kiḻava<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> civa<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> tēvaṭikaḷum kāṟaṉūr kiḻava<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> nākaṉ vēḷaṅ kōṉum niṉṟāṉ m<choice><orig>u</orig><reg>ū</reg></choice>vāyiravaṉum Ampalavaṉ niccaṉum cātta<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> kūttāṭiyum cāttaṉ coṉum cātta<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> kayi
                        <gap reason="lost" quantity="8" unit="character" precision="low"/>
                        m Ivvaṉaivōm Uḷḷiṭṭa Ūrōṃ It-tiruvavāṭutuṟai Uṭaiya ma<hi rend="grantha">hāde</hi>vaṟkku tirunon=tā-viḷakku 1 ṉukku nāṅkaḷ ceytu kuṭutta nila<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <hi rend="check">Eṅkaḷ<choice><orig>u</orig><reg>ū</reg></choice>r-t <unclear>t</unclear>eṉṟ’ ūril</hi><!--contra ASI transcript--> 
                        nakaṉ vāy y-eṉṟu pērkuvappaṭum vāykkāluk=kum eṉṟu per-kūvappaṭum vāykkāluk=ku teṟku Ik-kāṟaṉūr <hi rend="grantha">jeṣṭai</hi>yār nilattukku mēṟkum Ik-kāṟaṉūr tiru-vaṅk<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice><hi rend="grantha">śva</hi>ram-uṭaiya ma<hi rend="grantha">hā-de</hi>var <hi rend="grantha">śrī-ba</hi>li-p-puram-āṉa nilattukku vaṭakku
                        <lb n="10"/>Ik-kāṟaṉūr-k kōnilattukku kiḻakkum Araṅkaṉ vāy eṉṟu pēr-kūvappaṭum vāykkalukku teṟku
                        Āka
                        Ivv-icaitta peru-nāṅk’ ellaiyilum Akappaṭṭa nila<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> māḷikai-k-kōlāl <choice><orig>ṉ</orig><reg>n</reg></choice>ūṟu kuḻi koṇṭatu Oru mā v-āka
                        Ulak’ aḷan=ta paṭi nilattiṉ k<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ḻ nilan 3 <g type="numeral">1/20</g>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        In-nilan muṉṟu māvum ca<hi rend="grantha">ndrādi</hi>t=tavaṟ Iṟaiyil nivan=tam āka-t tiru-nontā
                        <gap reason="lost" quantity="8" unit="character" precision="low"/>
                        1 ṟu ceytu kuṭuttōm kāṟaṉūr Ivvaṉaivōm Uḷḷiṭṭa Ūrōm In-nilañ cuṭṭi-t tirukkoṟa-vācalil pō<unclear>nta</unclear> kuṭim<unclear>ai</unclear> Eppērppaṭṭatu In-nilan cuṭṭi vantu nāṅkaḷē kāttu-k kuṭukka In-nilan Iṟai-Iḻi Aṉupavittu It-tiru-nontā-viḷakku <hi rend="grantha">candrādi</hi>t<unclear>=ta</unclear>vaṟ E<unclear>ri</unclear>kka Oru-kāl-āvatum Iru-kāl-<choice><sic>a</sic><corr>ā</corr></choice>vatum mu-k-kāl-āvatum Iṟai
                        <lb n="11" break="no"/>-Ili nivan=tām-āka-c can<hi rend="grantha">drādi</hi>t=tavaṟ ceytu kuṭuttōm
                        kāṟaṉūr kīḻavaṉ kāḷaṉ caṅkara-nārayaṇaṉum
                        kāṟaṉūr kiḻavaṉ kaṉakaṉan=ti Aṭikaḷum
                        kāṟaṉūr kiḻava<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> civa<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> tēvaṭikaḷum
                        kāṟaṉūr kiḻavaṉ nākaṉ vēḷaṅ kōṉum
                        niṉṟāṉ mūvāyiravaṉum
                        Ampalavaṉ piccaṉum
                        cāttaṉ kūttāṭiyum
                        cāttaṉ can=tiraṉum
                        cāttaṉ kayila
                        <gap reason="lost" quantity="8" unit="character" precision="low"/>
                        Ivvaṉaivōm Uḷḷiṭṭa Ūrōm Ivarkaḷ colla Ivv-āvaṇam Eḻuti<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>ē<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> Ik-kāṟaṉūr karaṇattāṉ vēl kovaṉ tāḻi civa Iraṇatt-ēṉ
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Ivai ye<choice><orig>ṉṉ</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> eḻuttu
                    </p>                    
                    
                    <p>
                        Ip-paṭi Aṟivēṉ kavāli cuṟṟiyaṉ-āṉa kāṟaṉūr-p peruṅ-kollaṉ-ēṉ
                    </p>
                    
                    <p>
                        Ip-paṭi Aṟivē<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> kāṟaṉūr kiḻavaṉ nākaṉ vēḷḷaṅ-kōṉ-ēṉ <surplus>Ip-pa</surplus>
                    </p>
                    
                    <p>
                        <lb n="12"/><unclear>I</unclear>ppaṭi Āṟivēṉ niṉṟāṉ muvāyiravēṉ</p>
                    <p>Ip-paṭi Āṟivēṉ kāṟaṉūr ki<lb n="13" break="no"/>ḻava<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> kan=tiyaṭikaḷe<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice></p>
                    
                    <p>
                        Itu pa<hi rend="grantha">nmaheśva</hi>ra-ra<hi rend="grantha">kṣai</hi>
                    </p>
                </div>
                
                
