                    <head xml:lang="eng">First Part: year 6 of Rājendra</head>
                    
                    <p n="1">Prosperity! Fortune!</p>
                    
                    <p n="2">
                        6th year of the glorious king Rājendra Cōḻa alias the king Parakesarivarman
                    </p>
                    
                    <p n="1-2">
                        who took ... [<foreign>meykkīrtti</foreign> of Rājendra I Cōḻa].
                    </p>
                    
                    <p>...</p>
                    
                </div>
                
                <div type="textpart" n="B">      
                    <head xml:lang="eng">Second Part: year 5 of ...</head>
                    
                    <p n="8">
                        Moreover, in 5th year of this king.
                    </p>
                    
                    <p>...</p>
                    
                    <p n="13">This <supplied reason="subaudible">is under</supplied> the protection of the many great devotees of Īśvara.<note>That is, Śiva.</note></p>
                    
                </div>
                
